local ccb = require("ccb")

local tips = ccb.content.SnippetCategory { id = "tip" }
tips:text(ccb.content.text("Fires can spread easily, especially with abundance of fuel."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("Light itself doesn't draw zombies, it's sight, noise, or smell."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("Moose may not be your friend."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("Turnout gear protects from fire but not from overheating."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("Peek around corners, when crouching, or up/down stairs to check for enemies."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("Cold food lasts longer.  Find a cool basement or make a root cellar."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("Dying is part of the experience.  Try again with what you've learned."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("Frozen food?  Put it by a fire or heat it up in a pan."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("Underground spaces like basements or caves stay cool year-round."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("Afraid of wildlife?  Yell until it goes away.  But beware of what comes instead."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("Animals and zombies are not friends.  You can take advantage of that."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("A door is not the only way in or out of most places."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("Don't fight against the odds.  There's no shame in running to survive."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("You don't have to sit right next to fire to use it."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("Many items have special actions.  Try to find out what they do."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("Just because a place is dangerous doesn't mean it's worth looting."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("If you're breaking in, be sure you also know how to get back out."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("There's usually more than one way to do things.  Think outside the box."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("Survival order: shelter, water, food, then everything else."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("Balance armor versus encumbrance.  Even dropping a backpack can help in melee."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("Scared of melee?  Throw some things at enemies and use reach weapons like spears."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("Makeshift weapons can break easily, but they are weapons, and can be made again."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("Not much survives a car at 120mph.  Can you?"))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("Drugs are great for quick morale boosts and more, but beware of addiction and overdose."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("Use your map wisely.  Prioritize looting places that will get you what you need."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("Wounds heal over time.  An antiseptic and bandages speed that up."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("Don't get grabbed by zombies.  Their bites can be infectious."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("Feeling odd after waking up?  Try eating healthier and your health may improve."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("Eat well or your health might suffer.  Fast food is only good in a pinch."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("Nature can provide.  You can live off the land if you learn how."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("Raw food and water from unsafe sources can't be healthy.  Right?"))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("Why walk when you can use a car?  Or a bike?  Or rollerblades?"))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("Food from before the Cataclysm won't last forever.  Keep that in mind."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("You can make unusual things from usual stuff.  Go full MacGyver style if needed."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("There are fungi you want to eat, and those you want to burn.  You'll know the difference."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("Having a backup weapon is wise.  So is having a backup plan."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("Wet and angry?  A dry towel will bring your smile back."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("Like to gamble?  Use mutagen!  Be a winner today!"))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("Smoking and napping is asking for more than a hole in your shirt."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("You're on fire?  Stop and wait to put it out."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("Routine kills.  Stay alert!  Don't let your guard down."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("Most medicine doesn't work instantly, so don't swallow a whole bottle of pills."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("Famous last words:  Let's poke this electric zombie with a metal stick."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("A full stomach will not solve your starvation.  Give it time and eat regularly."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("Be mindful of the environmental protection of your gear.  It can take you places."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("Don't overlook protective equipment, such as gas masks and/or turnout gear.  You never know."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("Out of resources?  Breaking or disassembling stuff can yield interesting components."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("Temperature affects the shelf life of foods.  The colder, the better."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("Frozen food doesn't rot, but may be inedible if not defrosted."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("Some dry foods can be eaten frozen.  Some foods become mushy after defrosting."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("Thirsty on a long winter journey?  Take a thermos with you."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("'Tis but a scratch?'  Bandage and disinfect it anyway to speed up healing."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("Terrain that slows you down will also slow down your enemies."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("When the whole town is one big supermarket, a shopping cart becomes your best friend."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("Different characters, professions, hobbies, and scenarios can spice up your game.  Roleplay!"))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("A survivor saved is a friend earned.  Most of the time…"))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("Learning how to play?  Visit the keybindings menu and learn your ropes."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("Expect the unexpected, even if it's the Spanish Inquisition."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("You can throw things while peeking around corners.  Perfect for taking down bandits."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("There's got to be some cool stuff in those top-secret underground labs, right?"))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("Put a funnel over a jug or barrel to collect rainwater over time."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("The number of zombies in a city is large but finite.  You can (eventually) kill them all."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("Did you *only* take everything not nailed down?  Go back for the nails!"))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("You can make your own safe mode rules in the pause menu."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("The best gun in the world is useless without ammo."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("Most zombies go through cars, not around them.  Remember that when running away."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("If you're stuck inside with a broken leg, read some books to pass the time."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("Wounded?  Take it easy and you'll heal faster.  Keep straining yourself and your body will struggle to heal!"))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("Don't be too greedy.  Loot doesn't matter if you're dead."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("The floor is too hard to sleep on?  Try gathering a pile of leaves."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("Too cold to sleep well at night?  A pile of clothes will make it better."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("Major blood loss?  Drink plenty, supplement iron, and rest to regenerate your red blood cells."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("Major blood loss?  Saline infusions can keep your heart beating, but you'll want to rest until your blood comes back."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("Arterial bleeding from a gunshot?  A tourniquet can buy you time to stop the bleeding."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("No bandages nearby?  Empty your hands and let the time pass to apply pressure to the wound.  It's better than nothing."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("Tis but a scratch?  Minor bleeding does not require any dressing.  A Band-Aid is sufficient enough."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("Need to sort a bunch of stuff?  Your character can do it automatically with the zone manager."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("Every sensei was once a student.  NPCs can teach you and vice versa."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("Length matters… at least when it comes to shoving a shovel in your backpack."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("Where did my lighter go again?  Manage your containers to store specific items in them."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("Keep essentials in your clothing pockets in case you have to ditch your backpack."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("Exercising and being active increases your cardio and therefore your stamina pool."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("Long trip ahead?  Auto travel and auto drive to your desired destination."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("You can automate repetitive tasks such as foraging, mining, or mopping for your convenience."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("You can crouch or go prone to hide behind objects and reduce the sound you make when moving."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("When you are prone, you use the bipod of your rifle for better accuracy."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("Dissecting bodies will help in gaining knowledge about the weaknesses of the opponents."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("An armored enemy?  Don't give up, maybe it has some weaknesses that can be exploited."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("Need experience with crafting and such?  Use the training recipes to master the ins and outs."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("Remember that the sidebar is customizable and widgets can be added and removed from it."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("Power move.  You can take control and play as your NPC follower."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("Your skills can rust, but you'll learn them faster when you pick them up again."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("Save time.  Instead of using a recipe, place water in a container on a fire to boil it."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("Knowledge can't replace practical skill and experience, but it will help you get them faster."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("Books carry knowledge and often recipes.  You need practical skills to utilize them.  Practice."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("Being skilled does not mean being proficient.  Gain proficiency to become a master in specific areas."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("Prolonged physical exhaustion results in weariness.  Overworking causes loss of productivity."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("Mark the items you carry as favorites so you can easily identify new items and drop them in bulk."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("Verticality is a thing.  If you can get to a roof somehow, it may save your life."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("Your enemy is often slower than you.  Walk to conserve stamina and run only when you must."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("Fight on your conditions whenever you can.  Use terrain, traps, and fire to your advantage."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("Pick your fights and don't let them pick you.  Don't bite what you can't chew."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("Learn to use zone sorting to sort your loot in one go.  Y to set up zones, O to sort items."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("Want to loot everything not nailed down in one go?  Use zone manager to fill your hoard."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("You can view local keybindings in most sub-menus by pressing the question mark (?) key."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("There are some unbound keybindings that might prove useful for your needs.  Check them out."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("Check what you can craft from time to time, even if you don't have components right now."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("Where applicable, use blacklists, whitelists, and filters for a better quality of life."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("Many items have contextual uses.  Use the item action menu to find out what you can do with them."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("The action menu can help you determine what you can do.  There are also some rare actions there."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("Auto-pickup settings can save you time when you need it.  It's fully customizable too."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("Feeling unwell?  Allow yourself to rest, even for a few days as needed.  Heal now, explore later."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("Overconfidence is a treacherous killer.  Leave yourself some leeway for unforeseen circumstances."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("Be mindful of what, when, and how much you eat.  A balanced diet is crucial in the long run."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("Skillful management of stamina is crucial for your survival.  Conserve it when you can."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("For free in the construction menu: a crafting spot, a firewood source, and a practice target."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("When looking around, use T to move to a destination or item automatically."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("You can use your mouse to move to a destination by double-clicking it."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("You can use your mouse in your inventory and few other menus."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("Crafting is faster if you have an actual place for it, preferably a workshop bench."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("Hope for the best but prepare for the worst.  A backup stash of necessities can save the day."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("Pain can drastically slow you down and reduces your stats.  Check your speed in the character menu."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("Winners don't do drugs.  They're too valuable.  Winners trade drugs for more bullets."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("If you don't have a certain proficiency, having a related book is a good idea.  More books make you less likely to fail, but not as good as knowing the subject for yourself."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("Your character will automatically pack your pockets as efficiently as possible.  If you need to keep a pocket open, consider changing the pocket settings."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("You can set priority levels for pockets in your inventory, letting you fine-tune where your loot goes."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("Face masks can help protect from smoke and disease, but make it harder to breathe, affecting stamina."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("The burglar alarm for a store won't go off if you break through the wall."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("You can keep a diary if you set the keybinding.  Use it to roleplay, take notes, and keep score."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("Some weapons have techniques that let you do things like hit faster, block attacks, or stun opponents."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("If brute force isn't working, you're not using enough of it."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("Sweat is simulated in Cataclysm.  Excessive sweating will dehydrate you quickly but keep you cool."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("Feral humans are smarter than zombies.  They throw rocks and can even open doors.  Watch out!"))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("If you want something to stop existing, setting it on fire is a tried and true method."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("The higher up you are, the farther you can see on the overmap."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("Nobody wants to buy filthy underwear.  Wash your clothes to get a better price for them."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("There's an ocean to the East from your starting location.  Might be worth checking it out!  But beware, the East is where the population centers were, it's infested with zombie hordes now."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("Want a less populated and urbanized map?  Go West or North!  The map gets more rural the further you go."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("Want a more populated and urbanized map?  Go South or East!  The map gets more urban the further you go."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("Zombies are dumb, mindless brutes, but be aware that other monsters can be smarter.  Hiding in the closet is all well and good until something opens the door…"))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("Wondering why the solar panels on the roof aren't connecting to the floor below?  You need an extension cord to transmit power between Z-levels."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("Cities are incredibly dangerous places, exponentially more so as you get closer to the center.  Raiding rural and residential areas may help get you the edge you need."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("Many zombies struggle to see in the dark, you can use this to your advantage to sneak around.  Be careful, however, because you might meet something else that lurks in the dark…"))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("You can place pieces of furniture in front of the door to make it harder for zombies to break in."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("Some items are worn at your side, like sheathes and holsters, and can have the side they're worn on switched in the armor menu."))
tips:text(ccb.content.text("Just because a location is filled with zombies or well protected doesn't mean it has good loot for you in the Cataclysm.  Bank vaults full of cash and gold in the old world are filled with kindling in the new one."))
ccb.content.add(tips)

